You chant the glory of the Sun, granting you [16%, 22%, 27%, 30%, 34% (TL1-5; SP 100)] fire, lightning, acid and cold damage resistance, [34, 46, 55, 63, 70 (TL1-5; SP 100)] spell save and reduces the damage from enemies 3 or more spaces away by [12%, 19%, 24%, 27%, 30% (TL1-5)].

